{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415706","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415706","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1041570601:0":{"text":"その両腕は……蔓か？","source_cn":"你的双手……是藤蔓？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC7D9A08DCB5A14C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041570602:0":{"text":"突然すまない、その、とても不思議に思ったのでな。","source_cn":"请恕我冒昧。但它们看起来非常奇特。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x606B53517DF7DA56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041570603:1":{"text":"構わないよ。これは、俺の友人が速生蔓で作ってくれた義手なんだ。","source_cn":"没关系，这是我一位朋友发明的速生藤义肢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA46476EC7331C4DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041570604:1":{"text":"見ての通り俺は兵士だ。この両腕は、戦場で失った。","source_cn":"如你所见，我曾是一名士兵，双臂都毁于战场上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15D62D29C8D78ABD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041570605:1":{"text":"だが、幸運なことに俺はダミアンという、小さな発明家に出会えたんだ。","source_cn":"幸好我运气不错，偶然结识了达米安，他是个小发明家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x269F2ACF600808C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041570606:1":{"text":"蔓の義手か……本当に不思議だな。","source_cn":"藤蔓义肢……果然神奇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C59289A304B39CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041570607:1":{"text":"強度はどれぐらいなんだ？長期の使用に耐えられるのか？","source_cn":"它足够坚固吗？可以一直使用下去吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF300CFBB9A28AAC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041570608:1":{"text":"さすがに蔓で武器の攻撃を防ぐことはできないが、日常生活はだいぶ快適になった。","source_cn":"你不能期待藤蔓抵挡刀剑。它能做的，只是让我的生活更便利一点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEC437762F17ADDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041570609:1":{"text":"耐久性も悪くはない。ときおり交換が必要になるがな。","source_cn":"至于耐用性，不算太差，但时不时也需要更换。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAFD6887D68B1F20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041570610:1":{"text":"そう言えば、他の素材でもいくつか義手を作ったから、近々付けてみてほしいとダミアンが言ってたな。まったくあいつは……","source_cn":"达米安那小子上次还说他多准备了几种不同材质的手臂，就等...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96CF78C92C8C1D71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041570611:1":{"text":"いい友を持ったな。","source_cn":"有这样一位朋友，你很幸运。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C57F1E7A5D2EA4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041570612:1":{"text":"ああ。","source_cn":"的确。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B62A2E4E5CFCF53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041570613:1":{"text":"義手に興味があるのか？そんなものが必要には見えないが……","source_cn":"你对义肢很感兴趣？看起来你并不需要这种东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AAF8AF7268E344C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041570614:1":{"text":"戦争で、取り返しのつかないケガを負った部下が大勢いるんだ……","source_cn":"……我手下有很多士兵。战争让他们遭受了不可逆转的损伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DD8F7134D1C2ECC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041570615:1":{"text":"……なるほどな。","source_cn":"……我明白了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21AF200BB750A64F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041570616:1":{"text":"君は、兵を思いやれる良将なのだな。","source_cn":"有这种体恤士兵的想法，足以见得你是一位好将领。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B67CD53FEF2858F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041570617:1":{"text":"機会があれば、ダミアンに紹介しよう。あの子なら、その悩み事を解決できる妙案をたくさん持っているはずだ。","source_cn":"如果有机会，我可以带你去见见达米安。他应该有不少鬼点子...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEAE59E8D8482FBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041570618:1":{"text":"そうだな。機会があれば、ぜひ頼むよ。","source_cn":"希望会有那么一天。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C1CA5E98183E776","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:珀尔修斯":{"text":"ペルセウス","source":"珀尔修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:科林":{"text":"コリン","source":"科林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":2}}